<title>USA: TABLE-Spaghetti Warehouse Q4 shr rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Spaghetti Warehouse Q4 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>GARLAND, Texas 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>SPAGHETTI WAREHOUSE INC AND SUBSIDIARIES</p>
<p>		     Consolidated Statements of Operations</p>
<p>			52-Week     52-Week     13-Week     13-Week</p>
<p>			 Period     Period	Period	Period</p>
<p>			 Ended	 Ended	 Ended	 Ended</p>
<p>		     6/30/96	6/29/97     6/30/96     6/29/97</p>
<p>Total revenues</p>
<p>		   70,956,619  64,903,573  17,119,271  16,485,861</p>
<p>Restructuring charges</p>
<p>(reversals)</p>
<p>		   13,875,248   (740,000)	   ---   (340,000)</p>
<p>Gain on asset scheduled for divestiture</p>
<p>		     (47,178)	   ---    (47,178)	   ---</p>
<p>Income (Loss) from operations</p>
<p>		 (12,596,122)   1,663,656     664,371   1,235,219</p>
<p>Net income (loss)</p>
<p>		  (8,333,458)     658,935     265,852     757,611</p>
<p>Net income (loss) per common share:</p>
<p>   Primary	   (1.49)	  0.11	  0.05	  0.13</p>
<p>   Fully diluted   (1.49)	  0.11	  0.05	  0.13</p>
<p>Weighted average common and common share equivalents</p>
<p>outstanding:</p>
<p>   Primary	5,611,181   5,769,017   5,768,009   5,780,430</p>
<p>Fully diluted</p>
<p>		    5,611,181   5,825,535   5,768,009   5,841,505</p>
<p>Note: The company said fourth quarter results were favorably impacted by a $340,000 restructuring charge reversal relating to its February 1996 restructuring plan.</p>
<p>Additionally, a non-cash charge of $250,000 was recorded in the fourth quarter to write-down the former Cappellini's property to its estimated fair market value based on current real estate market conditions.</p>
<p>Excluding these non-operating items, fourth quarter net income was $658,254, or $.11 per share.</p>
<p>(( -- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
